  "description": "O Seon-Yul and Lee Ro-Un are two people who couldn’t be more different. But there’s a strange curse: whenever they’re alone together, they inevitably end up stuck together. They struggle desperately to avoid each other, but... \n\n*“Why on earth do you keep showing up in front of me?!”*\n\nA romance of forced closeness between two people who get tangled up together the more they try to avoid each other!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
